Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not getting enough sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:15.29,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I wasn't able to sleep very well last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is there no charm for sleeping well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.13,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,There is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Charm for getting good sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Have someone give you a lap pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:31.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,With this, a peaceful slumber is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:32.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:35.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is not a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:38.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But it does sound like you could get a good sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.90,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I had my brother do it for me often when I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.15,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,but now that I'm older...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:47.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:51.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How about having Tomoya-kun give you the lap pillow in place of your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.41,0:00:59.21,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I shouldn't. I would feel bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:02.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't worry. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:16.98,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Then I'll accept your offer and borrow him for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.32,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:31.20,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It feels... good...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:36.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She fell asleep in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:39.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't feel anything looking at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:44.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,To be honest, I am a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But when I see that look on her...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She must have been tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:55.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She must always be stressed over the fights Sudou-san and her friends get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.90,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yo ho! Is Yukine-chan here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let me have your delicious pilaf again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:05.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Making yourselves at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:08.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Hush please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.54,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Kazuto Nii-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:43.65,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
