Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:03:02.17,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:09.84,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
