Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:16.05,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:16.05,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:23.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:23.81,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:30.78,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:30.78,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.07,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.07,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.91,0:03:35.20,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.91,0:03:35.20,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:37.41,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:37.41,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.16,0:03:39.91,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.16,0:03:39.91,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:43.87,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:43.87,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:49.13,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:49.13,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:57.47,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I completely fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:00.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.68,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I'll let you use my lap next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.81,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I want to meet Yukine Onee-chan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.74,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:13.11,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Sudou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.87,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.87,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}A Courageous Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.70,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,They all think Sunohara-san is my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:25.42,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yeah. They think Kazuto-san got out of the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.22,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,They're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:38.05,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,They're afraid they have no chance of winning now that Miyazawa Kazuto's back on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:41.81,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,That's why they've panicked and have snuck over to our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:44.85,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,This was never supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But that's all a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:50.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah! It was Tomoyo who beat them up them yesterday and-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:50.65,Default-alt,Tom,0,0,0,,Miyazawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.40,Default-alt,Tom,0,0,0,,Regarding what happened yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:55.24,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Crap! I'll see you again, Yuki-nee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:56.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Sudou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:02.08,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Looks like I came at the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.55,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,So you guys got caught in another mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We didn't choose to be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:20.89,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,{\fscx107}It's all because you pretended to be Miyazawa Kazuto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.31,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I am familiar with the name Miyazawa Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:30.52,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor back when I was still fighting gangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:36.24,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It said Miyazawa Kazuto would be the only person who could fight me face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Face to face against you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:42.70,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I've heard many of your great stories, too, Sakagami-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:48.17,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I won't bring this matter up in school this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.00,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:51.50,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:56.26,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,The other day, I had a chance to talk to\Na member of another school's Student Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:59.80,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,There have been many fights in this city recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:05.06,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,At this rate, we will see the police become involved, sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:07.56,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Here's my advice. {ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.52,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Stop being fools and be friends. {ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.86,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Otherwise you'll all suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Those bastards! I'll kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:27.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Let's go raid their place right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.79,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.04,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We'll show them what we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.17,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:35.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa. When will your brother be discharged?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:39.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kazuto-san can stop the fight, right? {ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.51,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Onee-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:48.43,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'll go talk to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:49.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Miyazawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:51.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hold up, Miyazawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Think about it. It's not like you can solve anything even if you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:10.83,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm familiar to them, and I know where they hang out often, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your brother doesn't know what's going on? {ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:18.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if he's in the hospital, can't he convince Sudou and the others over the phone? {ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:30.27,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,I understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.73,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,So at this rate, both sides will be broken up, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:38.78,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Yes. If the fight escalates,\Nthe police may become involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,How do you expect us to back out now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:45.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}Since Miyazawa Kazuto's back on the streets,\Nwe have to take you guys down before we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Like I said, that was a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.62,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,How so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:51.87,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Last night, we got our asses kicked by your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was Sakagami Tomo-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:08:02.13,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yukine-san. We've got nothing against you, but we can't listen to you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.55,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We've got injured people on our side, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We can't stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.47,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Stop it you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.81,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,This is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:12.18,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We have to continue until one of us is crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:13.35,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is a fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.85,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:18.90,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,I said shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.45,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,You're all being rude to our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:30.41,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Yukine-san. You've treated my wounds before, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:36.88,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten the care\Nand the taste of the pilaf from that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:40.30,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,It's been a month, and he hasn't taken off the bandage yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:43.55,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sasaki-san likes girls who are good cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.13,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.18,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,No, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:52.81,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,But as you see, we can't let things end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:57.81,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,So, how does a one-on-one between the leaders sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:08:59.44,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,One-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:03.61,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Your brother and I will fight one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:06.20,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Whoever loses will submit to the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:08.82,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,That's the limit to the compromise we can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:15.16,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,And you agreed to that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:19.46,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee, how could you do that without talking to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:22.75,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That was the only choice I had in the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:27.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The time is tomorrow evening, at the river bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:30.93,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,But Kazuto-san can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:33.14,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,We have to send a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:35.98,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But will they agree to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:42.82,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey. They think Sunohara-san's Miyazawa Kazuto-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:45.24,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,That's right!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:50.03,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Please wait! Sunohara-san has nothing to do with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:56.66,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You were bragging yesterday that it was you who busted up four guys at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:58.42,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Four at once?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.25,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.59,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You'll totally do as Kazuto-san's substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:07.38,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,They often say "Don't judge a book by its cover", but wow, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:09.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:14.10,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sunohara Aniki! Please lend us your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:21.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Can I get another glass of this first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:28.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san. Will you really be doing a one-on-one fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:32.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't think fighting is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:36.79,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:41.21,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,They aren't that bad of people, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:48.01,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But when there are two groups in\Na small city, they can't help but clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:57.06,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Unless everyone in the city is happy,\Nno one is truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.60,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,They're all nice people individually,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:06.15,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,yet, why does this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:19.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Man, this is pretty nerve-wracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:21.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you still going to make us wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Wait until Sasaki-san comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:27.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,God, it feels like my heart's going to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:32.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san. How about filling\Nyour stomach while you have the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:35.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is a little something from my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:37.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,From Sanae-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:42.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}I said Sunohara-san would be having\Na very important fight, and so she made me bring this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:45.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Her newest creation. Hyper Rainbow Bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:50.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And a message from Dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,He said, "Rainbow to you".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:57.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And here's an ultimate jam made by her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:12:00.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you put this ultimate jam on Mom's bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:02.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,you've got yourself the ultimate combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:06.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Would you all like to try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.71,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We can?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.34,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:12.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:18.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's wrong, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.51,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Please get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.68,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:27.44,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What do we do? Everyone's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:31.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:33.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:34.95,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:38.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We don't have time to argue. Take care of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.08,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:45.79,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There's been a little misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:51.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He's actually not Miyazawa Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:54.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you'll have to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:59.64,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,It's no good. We need the real Miyazawa Kazuto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:02.06,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,Your brother won't come no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:08.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,To either fight Sasaki-san or stop the fight, we need Miyazawa-san's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:16.32,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll play with you a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:19.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Go, Aniki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.29,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:28.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:29.38,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.93,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Do you have a bad right shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:40.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I don't need you to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.06,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:17.44,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,You're one tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.99,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Enough. Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:25.53,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Looks like your boys are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:31.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:33.50,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Are you all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:38.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:39.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:41.93,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,What did you do to Yuki-nee's bud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.14,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Everyone, follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop it, Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:49.85,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Sasaki-san's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.02,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:52.14,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.82,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.87,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,K-Kazuto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.66,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:09.74,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.62,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,So that's the real Miyazawa Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:15.83,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,He snuck out of the hospital, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:19.25,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,As the rumors say, you've got balls, Miyazawa Kazuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:24.13,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,But I can't go easy on you.\NSorry, but I've got to beat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:32.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.73,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:43.61,Default,Sas,0,0,0,,Stop it. What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:45.45,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:47.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm Miyazawa Kazuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:49.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop it, Miyazawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.33,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:54.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,When did she...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:58.29,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,She went running, saying she'd go get her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:01.30,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I thought she went to the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.42,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,There's no way she can go get him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:07.89,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,There's no way she can go get Kazuto-san!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:09.39,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Let go!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:13.89,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.52,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee, it's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:16.27,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:19.15,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Why is she doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:24.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:29.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To stop you guys, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:33.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The only way to stop the fight is for Miyazawa Kazuto to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:36.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's why she pretended to be her brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:44.84,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Why... Why do we have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:48.13,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,What does it take to not fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:51.51,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,What does it... What does it take...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:18:00.48,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Please. Please stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:06.44,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I'm sure my brother wishes for that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So that was the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.54,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fnEdo SZ\fs63\fscy75\pos(1168.5,1021.5)\c&HFBFBED&\b1}M\Ni\Ny\Na\Nz\Na\Nw\Na\N \NF\Na\Nm\Ni\Nl\Ny\N \NG\Nr\Na\Nv\Ne
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:31.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fnEdo SZ\fs30\fscy75\c&HFBFBED&\b1\frx8\fry346\frz3.399\pos(1258.5,606)}M\Ni\Ny\Na\Nz\Na\Nw\Na\N \NF\Na\Nm\Ni\Nl\Ny\N \NG\Nr\Na\Nv\Ne
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:29.63,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,For the longest time, I was afraid of my brother and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:38.81,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,But seeing Sudou-san and Tajima-san cry at his funeral, I wondered...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:45.19,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,"Why didn't I try to understand his way of life more?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:50.78,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,That's why I mustered up some courage to get to know everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:53.91,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,At first, it was scary,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:59.79,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,but little by little, you all let me into the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:07.55,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,And being with you all made me feel like I was laughing with Kazuto Nii-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:13.26,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,My brother wished there were no fights until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:19.31,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}But if the truth of him missing were to be revealed,\Nwe thought Sasaki-san's group would come against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:25.94,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,That's why we talked matters over and\Ndecided to keep my brother's death a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:31.95,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,It was my brother's wish to be rid of fights from this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.58,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I wanted to realize that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.33,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,...no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:04.90,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kazuto Nii-san's happy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.05,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I feel at peace now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.01,0:20:38.68,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It could be that I've finally accepted what happened to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:43.56,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I owe it to all of you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.23,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Are you all familiar with this city's legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:51.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:55.99,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,The moment something good happens or a moment of happiness is experienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:58.32,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,an orb of light appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.91,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,No one knows what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:06.54,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,What is for certain is those lights are taken as symbols of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:11.05,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,And if you obtain one, any one wish can be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. Isn't this Misae-san's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:15.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:20.01,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But it looks like less and less people see them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:23.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So the light Okazaki says he saw is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:28.90,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Maybe Okazaki-san is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:29.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.61,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm not sure of anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:39.78,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But Okazaki-san, you're still you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:41.95,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,My important friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:46.33,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You're all my important friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.13,0:21:52.00,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm really a blessed person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:55.05,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm supported by so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.47,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Kazuto Nii-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:05.64,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
