Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:43.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What will you do once you graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.37,0:23:49.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You've got a really gloomy face so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:52.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Did you have a fight with Nagisa-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:55.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Something similar happened before, too, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:58.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I mean, at crucial times, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:01.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I hope it took his mind off things a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:23:59.67,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:02.72,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:06.35,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun isn't happy.
